---
export interface Props {
  lanes: Array<{ lane: string; label: string }>;
}

const { lanes } = Astro.props;
---

{lanes.length > 0 && (
  <aside class="concurrent-lanes" aria-label="同时发生提示">
    <span>HAPPENING IN PARALLEL</span>
    <ul>
      {lanes.map((lane) => (
        <li>
          <strong>{lane.lane}</strong>
          <p>{lane.label}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <small>这里表示两个现场在同一段时间发生，不把它们的时钟强行对齐。</small>
  </aside>
)}
